  "description": "\"The proposed single-storey rear extension (5.2m × 3m × 3.1m) is designed to provide additional open-plan living space, strictly adhering to Permitted Development rights (Class A, GPDO). The extension’s scale, materials, and flat roof ensure it respects the dwelling’s mid-terrace context and causes no harm to neighboring amenity. Prior Approval is sought as the extension extends 3m beyond the original rear wall.\" The existing house is 7.92m deep and there is a single story rear extension of 3.00m deep and house depth is 10.92m, now we are proposing 3.00m deep rear extension and the total extension will be 6.00m and the full length of house will be 13.92m.",
